'''Idol Mihara & Cat''' is an enemy that only appears in [[Hiroshi Mihara Awakens!]] They were added in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Idol Mihara & Cat
|image = E 448.png
|first appearance = [[Hiroshi Mihara Awakens!]]
|money drop = 5,000元 - 19,750元
}}

==Enemy==
A pathetic enemy, low health, low damage and overall low stats in every aspect.  The only slightly threatening thing about him is that he has a 50% chance to freeze the players [[Cat Units]], but even then it is only for three seconds meaning after it wears off your units will be unfrozen and able to attack as much as they can before getting frozen again.

==Strategy==
If you're for some reason afraid of this enemy, bring cats that are [[:Category:Cats with Freeze Immunity|immune to freeze]] or units that can outrange Idol Mihara & Cat.

